{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_028soi_1_7_028_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:14dd185a07ca56f6c52f702520c7220d96613890cda41a8299fa0e106cca02b9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_1_7_028_01:1_7_028_01:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0762b809a5f051bd5ab23aada64d562c909573d2b0671cec87c68196def2c3cc",
      "text": "庄一郎先生，今天也是您的生日吧！\n祝您生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_1_7_028_01:1_7_028_01:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e54a3984eb66be039aef292c8bd7e0baf63d83d4a3fc66984253b6bd0dc51a74",
      "text": "哎呀，非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_1_7_028_01:1_7_028_01:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6dc9a098d2599f0a05c4c9ca47bc1cf10d9e9b36b22ee35dcaa19b9da01cc2d",
      "text": "呵呵，能像这样得到●●●●プロデューサー的\n祝福，真是令人欣喜的惊喜呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_1_7_028_01:1_7_028_01:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37ae35bfa0ea1f1cb5e57db5093c8217b0d0b5ec3800cc8f5e3fc3665e9a9f74",
      "text": "这份谢礼，等到了●●●●プロデューサー\n生日的时候，我一定会回赠的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_028soi_1_7_028_01:1_7_028_01:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e62a8c431a9b70080e8e86213291e003dc9d2be67933896ff1afbf8299305e86",
      "text": "我会做特制甜点的，\n敬请期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
